  "reference": "I-Ca-Yaa 44",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuoth Nhial ɛ jɛn la Kuoth ɔ kärɔa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pal kuɔth jiaath thilɛ jɛ luɔt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛy diaal tin la̱tkɛ kuth jiɛn kɛ guäy, kä tin ca la̱t thilɛ kɛ luɔt. Kä nɛy tin ruac kɛ kɛ /cikɛ gui̱c kä kui̱c kɛn ŋɔak. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bakɛ jak kä po̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa mi dëë kuoth la̱t kä dëë ciik täth ala kuoth mi thilɛ mi bɛ jek thi̱n la̱t? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy diaal tin palkɛ jɛ bakɛ jak kä po̱c, kä tin la̱tkɛ jɛ kɛ naath. Akɛ duɔlkɛ rɔ̱ kä akɛ ka̱nkɛ gua̱thkiɛn, bakɛ jak kä dual, ba kɛn diaal jak kä po̱c.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu tääth ni bël yiëth ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ wä täth wi̱i̱ maac, cuɛ jɛ dɛŋ kɛ dey, cuɛ jɛ duäc kɛ buɔ̱m wuɔ̱ɔ̱knikɛ. Cu mäni mëë ci buɔth ɛ näk kä cɛ buɔ̱mdɛ thuk, kä thilɛ pi̱w ti cɛ math kä ci puɔ̱nydɛ bɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ŋäät jiɛn bëër kɛ̈k, cuɛ jɛ kɛ̈k kɛ galam jiaath, kä cuɛ jɛ ŋuɔ̱k kɛ car caarɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ thɛm kɛ theem. Cuɛ jɛ la̱t ala puɔ̱ny mi ce̱tkɛ raan, nikɛ ta̱a̱ gɔɔyä ran kä cuɛ ciɛŋ ni duel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ luɔ̱ɔ̱r jiɔap piny, kä cuɛ wä mɛk ni rit kiɛ dhuɔ̱ny kä cu piith nikɛn ala jiɛn ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m kä jiɛn ruɔ̱ɔ̱p diaal. Kä cuɛ luɔ̱ɔ̱r pith kä cu nhiaal kɛ jak kä do̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ cua tɔaŋ maac kä raan, cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋ jiaath la̱th maac kɛ ɣöö bɛ ɣɔ̱c kɛ jɛ, kä bulɛ jurayni kɛ macdɛ. Kä cuɛ kuoth la̱t kɛ jɛ mi palɛ, cuɛ jɛ ŋat ala puɔ̱ny mi goŋɛ rɔ nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋ jiaath pɛt mac, kä thaalɛ tha̱a̱ŋdɛ mi̱ethdɛ, kä bulɛ ri̱ŋ mi camɛ, kä ɣɔ̱cɛ kɛ tha̱a̱ŋdɛ wëë i̱, “Wa̱a̱ ci puɔ̱nydä leeth, cä ɣɔ̱c kɛ mac!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duɔth jiaath in dɔ̱ŋ lät ni kuoth min la kuoth jiaathdɛ, goŋɛ rɔ nhiamdɛ kä palɛ jɛ, la palɛ jɛ wëë i̱, “Kän ɣä, kɛ ɣöö ɛ ji̱n kuothdä!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn thilɛ mi ŋäc kɛn ɛ, kä thilɛ kɛ ca̱r, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ wäŋkiɛn kum thilɛ mi dëë nɛn kä ci wuɔ̱thkiɛn ga̱a̱k thilɛ mi dëë ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ram mi caar jɛ kiɛ mi tekɛ ŋäc mi dëë wee i̱, “Cä tha̱a̱ŋdɛ pɛt ni mac, kä cä jurayni bul kɛ mimkɛ, kä cä ri̱ŋ bul kɛ jɛ a cä jɛ cam. Ɛ bä mi jiääk ku la̱t kɛ min ci duɔth thi̱n? Ɛ dëë rɔ ku goŋ nhiam bakä jiaath?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn camɛ ni ŋɛ̈th, ci nyuɔɔn wecdɛ jɛ buath jɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä /cɛ rɔ dëë luäŋ kɛ ka̱n kiɛ derɛ wëë i̱, “/Ciɛ mɛ̈ɛ̈t ɛn mi te tetdä cuëëcdä mi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "/Ka̱n I-thɛ-rɛl pa̱l ruëëc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
